<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT BORDER 18-14 IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT BORDER 18-14 IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Lions beat Border 18-14 (halftime 10-8) in their rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Border - Tries: Andre Claasen. Penalties: Greg Miller (3).</p>
<p>British Lions - Tries: John Bentley, Mark Regan, Rob Wainwright. Penalty: Tim Stimpson.</p>
</text>
